sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title OIDC Authentication & MFA Flow (Validium/Paladin with Keycloak)

    participant B as User Browser
    participant I as Ingress/NGINX
    participant F as Frontend (SPA / Portal)
    participant A as Backend (OIDC Client/API)
    participant K as Keycloak (IdP)

    Note over F,A: Protected resource requested

    B->>I: GET /app
    I->>F: Serve app (no session)

    F-->>B: Redirect to Login (OIDC)
    B->>K: GET /auth/realms/<realm>/protocol/openid-connect/auth<br/>?client_id=<client>&response_type=code&scope=openid<br/>&redirect_uri=<callback>&code_challenge=<pkce_challenge>&code_challenge_method=S256

    K-->>B: Render login page

    B->>K: POST credentials (username/password)

    alt MFA required (per user/group/policy)
        K-->>B: Prompt MFA (TOTP / WebAuthn / SMS/Email)
        B->>K: Submit second factor
        K-->>K: Validate 2nd factor
    else MFA not required
        K-->>K: Continue flow
    end

    K-->>B: 302 Redirect to <callback>?code=<auth_code>&state=<state>
    B->>A: GET <callback>?code=<auth_code>&state=<state>

    A->>K: POST /protocol/openid-connect/token<br/>grant_type=authorization_code<br/>code=<auth_code><br/>redirect_uri=<callback><br/>client_id=<client><br/>code_verifier=<pkce_verifier>
    K-->>A: 200 { access_token (JWT), id_token (JWT), refresh_token }

    A-->>A: Validate JWT (iss, aud, exp) via JWKS
    A-->>F: Set app session / issue app cookie (httpOnly/SameSite)
    F-->>B: App dashboard

    B->>A: Subsequent API calls with Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
    A-->>A: Enforce AuthZ (roles/scopes + org_id/bic claims)
    A-->>B: 200 Response (authorized)

    Note over K: OIDC session managed by Keycloak (SSO)